The {!<span class="term term-national-front">!}Front{!</span>!} circulates the committee recommendation and the {!<span class="term term-parliament">!}Majles{!</span>!} decision as
separate stages. Its summary states plainly that approval of the principle
precedes the later rules needed to administer it.

The institutional record gives {!<span class="term term-senate">!}Senate{!</span>!} consideration a constitutional
