@senate_approval
title: The nationalization principle reaches the <span class="term term-senate">Senate</span>
subtitle: The upper chamber now tests the coalition assembled around the <span class="term term-parliament">Majles</span> vote
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: march_action_complete = 1 and nationalization_approved_majles = 1 and nationalization_approved_senate = 0
max-visits: 1
